        "content": "{\n  \"screenings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1702\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposal describes an exploratory research project into mechanistic interpretability rather than a concrete implementation of the specific, prescriptive logging requirements (e.g., timestamps, reference databases) mandated by Article 12. Given that approval commits scarce resources to execution rather than exploration, this 'knowledge frontier' approach is too speculative to ensure immediate regulatory compliance or institutional survival.\",\n      \"decision\": \"reject\",\n      \"promise\": 35\n    }\n  ]\n}",
